{"title":"Antlion Warrior","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 23 Antlion that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-warrior?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"antlion-warrior\" data-map-level=\"23\">Show level 23 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"antlion-mandible\" title=\"Antlion Mandible - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3af9398e31b21e1c0d76.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Mandible</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-head\" title=\"Bearhide Head (weasel x1) - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b31cec1ed7b01d27c08d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1 · Enchanted: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"chitin-plate\" title=\"Chitin Plate - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Chitin Plate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Skentz%20Scrapyard\">Skentz Scrapyard</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"antlion-warrior\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Antlion: <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling\">Antlion Pitling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion\">Antlion</a> <span class=\"muted\">(19)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-queen\">Antlion Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/b5029fb77b47ad26a284.webp\" alt=\"Antlion Warrior\"></div><h3>Antlion Warrior</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 23)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Antlion</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>79</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>17.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>4 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}